Inline Common EducationContentSource
    documentation "Published papers, reports, or other educational documents."
    domain entity EducationContent
        documentation "Relates the education content source to the education content."
        is optional collection
    shared string LearningResourceMetadataURI
        documentation "The URI (typical a URL) pointing to the metadata entry in a LRMI metadata repository, which describes this content item."
        is optional collection
    shared string URI
        documentation "The URI (typical a URL) pointing to an education content item."
        is optional collection
